WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.835 --> 00:00:15.104
Eddy drove onto the track.

2
00:00:15.105 --> 00:00:20.676
"Slow, slow, slow!" Zippy sang.

3
00:00:20.677 --> 00:00:24.334
Eddy gritted his teeth.

4
00:00:24.335 --> 00:00:27.834
Eddy drove between the cones.

5
00:00:27.835 --> 00:00:29.999
He saw the stop sign.

6
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.750
Eddy slowed down.

7
00:00:32.751 --> 00:00:35.219
"You are really slow!"

8
00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:38.427
Zippy laughed.

9
00:00:38.428 --> 00:00:46.713
Eddy felt hot.

10
00:00:46.714 --> 00:00:49.736
His dumper shook.

11
00:00:49.737 --> 00:00:53.472
"I'm not slow!" Eddy yelled.

12
00:00:53.473 --> 00:01:03.545
Vroom! Eddy went fast—too fast!

13
00:01:03.546 --> 00:01:09.111
"Slow down!" cried Ms. Fender.

14
00:01:09.112 --> 00:01:17.884
Eddy flew past a red light.

15
00:01:17.885 --> 00:01:35.313
He crashed into cones.

16
00:01:35.314 --> 00:01:44.342
"That was not safe!" said Ms. Fender.

17
00:01:44.343 --> 00:01:46.988
Eddy sighed.

18
00:01:46.989 --> 00:01:52.970
"I'm sorry."

19
00:01:52.971 --> 00:01:56.967
"Zippy," said Ms. Fender.

20
00:01:56.968 --> 00:02:01.440
"You must stop being a bully."

21
00:02:01.441 --> 00:02:04.751
"Fine," Zippy said.

22
00:02:04.752 --> 00:02:07.504
Eddy drove on the track again.

23
00:02:07.505 --> 00:02:11.922
"Eddy is slow," said Zippy.

24
00:02:11.923 --> 00:02:19.591
"No! Eddy is safe!" said Ms. Fender.

25
00:02:19.592 --> 00:02:30.746
Everyone honked.
